/// Box-aliveness equation — Core{} state and aliveness invariant for 3ox
```

─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
BOX-ALIVENESS EQUATION — Refined for 3ox
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Pulse(t)   ≔ Δt → εt → σt
Tape(t)    ≔ ρt → μt
Warden(t)  ≔ Verify(Pulse(t), Tape(t))
Axis₃(t)   ≔ ⟨Warden(t), Tape(t), Pulse(t)⟩
Encode₆(t) ≔ ⟨Intent, Authority, State, Route, Memory, Seal⟩
Ring₉(t)   ≔ ⟨Intake, Validate, Encode, Route, Execute, Observe, Digest, Commit, Recover⟩
System₉(t) ≔ ⟨Meta, Tron, Chmod, Daemon, Cage, Route, Hash, Vault, Patch⟩
Core₂₇(t)  ≔ ⟨Axis₃(t), Encode₆(t), Ring₉(t), System₉(t)⟩
Box₃(t)    ≔ Axis₃(t)

ValidBox₃(t) ≔ I[Pulse(t)]·I[Tape(t)]·I[Warden(t)] = 1
ValidCore₂₇(t) ≔ I[Axis₃(t)]·I[Encode₆(t)]·I[Ring₉(t)]·I[System₉(t)] = 1
Authoritative(t) ≔ I[CanonSource(t)]·ValidBox₃(t) = 1
Success(t) ≔ Authoritative(t)·I[Goal(t)=reached] = 1
Repeatable(C) ≔ ∀t ∈ Runs(C), ValidBox₃(t)=1 under same law

─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
REFINEMENTS
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

I[x] ≔ indicator: 1 if x passes structural + hash check, else 0
I[x] ≔ (structure_valid(x) ∧ hash_chain_valid(x)) ? 1 : 0

CanonSource(t) ≔ cube root + _meta contract present
CanonSource(t) ≔ path(.3ox) ∧ exists(_meta/WHOAMI.md) ∧ exists(_meta/SESSION.CHECKPOINT.toml)

Goal(t)=reached ≔ route completed with receipt
Goal(t)=reached ≔ ∃r ∈ Tape(t) : r.status=COMPLETE ∧ r.intent=route(t).intent

Core{} law:
- Axis authorizes.
- Encode transforms.
- Ring sequences.
- System protects.
- Nothing leaves Core{} unencoded.

─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
3OX MAPPING
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Pulse  → (6)Pulse: run.rb, 3ox.log, receipts/
Tape   → vec3/var/receipts/, event stream, merkle.root
Warden → limits.toml, write_policy, validate at commit

Core{} → protected 27-slot execution chamber
Axis   → Warden, Tape, Pulse
Encode → Intent, Authority, State, Route, Memory, Seal
Ring   → Intake, Validate, Encode, Route, Execute, Observe, Digest, Commit, Recover
System → Meta, Tron, Chmod, Daemon, Cage, Route, Hash, Vault, Patch

System grouping:
- Anchor[2]  → Meta, Tron
- Control[4] → Chmod, Daemon, Cage, Route
- Seal[3]    → Hash, Vault, Patch



─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
RUNTIME CHECK
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Executable check:

```bash
ruby .vec3/rc/run.rb aliveness
```

Pass condition:
- authoritative = true
- valid_box3 = true

Failure means one or more of Pulse/Tape/Warden/Canon source is broken.

:: ∎
